              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೊಳಲು (koḷalu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 1818 lists the Kannada word for a flute, a fife, beside a word for a tube, a blow-pipe; ಕೊಳವೆ, a pipe, is that second word."
