            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಂಗೀತ ಕಚೇರಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಅವರು ಪಿಟೀಲು ನುಡಿಸಿದರು. saṅgīta kacēriyalli avaru piṭīlu nuḍisidaru. He played the violin at the concert."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In southern concerts it follows the singer."
            }
          ]
        },
